{"ID":"20240205153644-1nc0eoh","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153644-1nc0eoh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153644-1nc0eoh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206093927-6q0eaq5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164227-x5daab2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:600,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206093927-6q0eaq5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:162,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:162\u0026#125;","title":"白果","type":"doc","updated":"20240902111622"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206093927-6q0eaq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093927-6q0eaq5","updated":"20240206093937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产广西、四川、湖北、江苏等地。\n【性状】\t除去外种皮的种子卵形或椭圆形，长1.53cm，宽12.2cm。外壳 (中种皮) 骨质，光滑，表面黄白色或淡棕黄色，基部有一圆点状突起，边缘各有1条棱线，偶见3条棱线。内种皮膜质，红褐色或淡黄棕色。种仁扁球形，淡黄色，胚乳肥厚，粉质，中间有空隙；胚极小。气无，味微甘、苦。\n【性味】\t甘、苦、涩，平，有小毒。\n【功效】\t敛肺定喘；止带缩尿。哮喘痰嗽；白带；白浊；遗精；尿频；无名肿毒； 皶鼻。"}]},{"ID":"20240206093930-ildw87b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093930-ildw87b","updated":"20240206093930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206093929-893qtiq.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205164227-x5daab2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205164227-x5daab2","updated":"20240717160846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 466px;","style":"width: 456px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白果"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白果-20240205164227-pd7d3oq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 456px;\" parent-style=\"width: 466px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 754px;","style":"width: 744px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白果 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白果 2-20240717160846-etuqp7x.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 744px;\" parent-style=\"width: 754px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717160632-xk9z81v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717160632-xk9z81v","updated":"20240729085802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 458px;","style":"width: 448px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白果 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白果 1-20240717160632-udtg1pg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 448px;\" parent-style=\"width: 458px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 417px;","style":"width: 407px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白果 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白果 4-20240717161115-rpefea8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 407px;\" parent-style=\"width: 417px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 361px;","style":"width: 351px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBra